# Realms: any table becomes quantum states. Each record is read in two incompatible bases —
#   anchor (exact cents ⊗ a date window)  and  meaning (a superposition of its words).
# Same money + orthogonal meaning = a COLLISION; same money + same meaning = an AGREEMENT.
realm books = load("examples/data/books.csv")
realm invoices = load("examples/data/invoices.json")
compare books, invoices within 3
expect agreements(books, invoices, 3) == 2         # concrete, permit
expect collisions(books, invoices, 3) == 1         # $8,800: cabinets in the books, furniture on the invoice
expect fidelity(books[0], invoices[0]) == 3/4      # |A∩B|²/(|A||B|) = 3²/(3·4), exact
swaptest books[0], invoices[0]                     # the real swap-test circuit gives the same number
grover books where amount > 10000                  # quantum search over the realm, exact success probability
